   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Rural Facade Colour</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Rural Facade Colour\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication of the visual-integration survey of farm buildings in the countryside of Extremadura, Spain, with the paper's own photomontages. Ten real rural buildings, five of the residential-winery type (I) and five of the agriculture-livestock type (II), are each shown in two versions edited in Photoshop: A, facades whitewashed or painted white, and B, walls painted a suitable colour other than white. Participants see the 20 scenes one at a time and answer the paper's question, 'Rate the visual integration of each building with its surroundings from 1 to 10' (1 = very bad, 10 = very good). Rebuilt from Montero-Parejo, Garcia Moruno, Reyes Rodriguez, Hernandez Blanco & Garrido Velarde (2020), Analysis of facade color and cost to improve visual integration of buildings in the rural environment, Sustainability 12(9): 3840, Section 2.6, with the 20 scenario images from its Tables 2 and 3 (CC BY 4.0, used unchanged). Image ids: I1_A to I5_B and II1_A to II5_B (typology, building number, corrective measure A or B); the answer integration (1-10) is keyed by image id. Analysis as in the paper: mean rating per image, then a repeated-measures ANOVA with typology (I or II) and corrective measure (A or B) as within-subject factors and Bonferroni pairwise comparisons. The paper (main survey, 120 inhabitants and university students) found coloured facades (B) rated higher than white ones (6.24 against 5.58) and residential-winery buildings higher than agriculture-livestock ones (6.14 against 5.68), with white facades rated alike in both typologies; scores above 5 were read as acceptable integration. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper showed printed 10 x 15 cm photos in a face-to-face interview with a researcher present; here the images are shown on screen, and the images in the paper's tables are smaller (about 360 pixels wide) than the photos used in the survey; (2) the paper does not give the order of the photos, so the 20 scenes appear in random order; (3) gender and age are asked as in the paper's preliminary survey, but their wording is ours, and the place-of-origin and income questions are left out; (4) the introduction and consent text are ours.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other or prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 100\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"scenes\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"integration\",\n      \"title\": \"Rate the visual integration of each building with its surroundings from 1 to 10\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"1\",\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"2\",\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"3\",\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"4\",\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"5\",\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"6\",\n        \"text\": \"6\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"7\",\n        \"text\": \"7\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"8\",\n        \"text\": \"8\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"9\",\n        \"text\": \"9\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"10\",\n        \"text\": \"10\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"pv-original\">{\"source\": \"Montero-Parejo et al. (2020) Sustainability 12(9): 3840\", \"n\": 120, \"ids\": [\"I1_A\", \"I1_B\", \"I2_A\", \"I2_B\", \"I3_A\", \"I3_B\", \"I4_A\", \"I4_B\", \"I5_A\", \"I5_B\", \"II1_A\", \"II1_B\", \"II2_A\", \"II2_B\", \"II3_A\", \"II3_B\", \"II4_A\", \"II4_B\", \"II5_A\", \"II5_B\"], \"result\": {\"B\": 6.239, \"A\": 5.581, \"I\": 6.138, \"II\": 5.683}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f2f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#1d1d1b;--muted:#5d5c57;--accent:#2b5d7a;--line:#dad8d2;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#dce9f1}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}\n.fig{overflow-x:auto;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px}\n.fig .in{min-width:0;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto}.fig .in.wide{min-width:560px;max-width:none}\n.crop{overflow:hidden;position:relative}.crop img{position:absolute;left:0;width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\ntextarea,input[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;margin-top:6px}\n.qno{color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}\n.fig .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);text-align:center;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 0 6px}\n.hint{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0}\n@media (min-width:700px){.hint{display:none}}\n.picks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;margin-top:12px}\n.picks label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 6px;font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}\n.picks label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.picks input{display:none}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\n.q.miss,.picks.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.95rem}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;max-width:140px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.drow{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 0}.drow:first-child{border-top:0}\n.drow b{display:block;margin-bottom:6px}\n.scale{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px}\n.scale label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:9px 2px;font-size:.84rem;cursor:pointer;background:#fff;line-height:1.2;min-height:44px}\n.scale label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}\n.scale input{display:none}\n.drow.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\n.photo{max-width:600px;margin:0 auto}.photo img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:10px}\n.ten{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,1fr);gap:6px;margin-top:10px}\n@media (max-width:560px){.ten{grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}}\n.ten label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;min-height:46px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;background:#fff}\n.ten label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.ten input{display:none}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\n.ten.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photomontages: Montero-Parejo, García Moruno, Reyes Rodríguez, Hernández Blanco &amp; Garrido Velarde (2020), Sustainability 12(9): 3840, Tables 2–3 (doi:10.3390/su12093840, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='rural-colour:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('pv-original').textContent), IDS=ORIG.ids;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1));var t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(IDS),i:0};}\n  function chs(q){return (q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return typeof c==='string'?{value:c,text:c}:c;});}\n  function radios(n){var q=Q[n];return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+chs(q).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function pick(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function bad(n,m){var el=app.querySelector('[data-q=\"'+n+'\"]');el.classList.add('miss');el.scrollIntoView({block:'center'});err(m||('Please answer: '+Q[n].title));}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Farm buildings in the countryside</h1><p>You will see 20 photos of rural buildings in Extremadura, Spain. For each photo, rate how well the building blends in with its surroundings from 1 (very bad) to 10 (very good). Answer with your first impression. It takes about 4 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label></div><div class=\"card\">'+radios('gender')+\n     '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"age\"><b>'+esc(Q.age.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" id=\"age\" min=\"16\" max=\"100\"></div>'+\n     '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      var g=pick('gender');if(g==null)return bad('gender');\n      var a=document.getElementById('age').value.trim(),x=Number(a);if(!a||!(x>=16&&x<=100)||Math.round(x)!==x)return bad('age','Please enter your age as a whole number between 16 and 100.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true),SPSite.answer('gender',g),SPSite.answer('age',x)],this,function(){st.step='scenes';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function scene(){\n    var id=st.order[st.i],f=files[id];\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Photo '+(st.i+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><h2>'+esc(Q.integration.title)+'</h2>'+\n     '<div class=\"photo\"><img alt=\"Rural building in its landscape\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"ten\" data-q=\"integration\">'+chs(Q.integration).map(function(c){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"integration\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\">'+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"ends\"><span>1 = very bad</span><span>10 = very good</span></div>'+\n     '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.i+1<st.order.length?'Next':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v=pick('integration');if(v==null){app.querySelector('.ten').classList.add('miss');return err('Please choose a number from 1 to 10.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('integration',Number(v),{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.i++;if(st.i>=st.order.length)st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st=fresh();save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&(e.target.closest('.ten')||e.target.closest('.q'));if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('change',clr);app.addEventListener('input',clr);\n  function route(){window.scrollTo(0,0);if(st.step==='scenes')return scene();if(st.step==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','age','integration'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"scenes\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order&&st.order.length===IDS.length)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
